{"id":"menge","lemma":"Menge","pos":"noun","rank":436,"glosses":["quantity","multitude","crowd, gathering of people"],"ipa":"/ˈmɛŋə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a3/De-Menge.ogg/De-Menge.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Menge","plural":"Mengen"},"formAudio":{"Mengen":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Djknusper-mengen.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich habe eine Menge Bücher.","en":"I have a lot of books.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700933","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"book (collection of…","l":"Buch"}]},{"text":"Wir haben eine Menge Spaß.","en":"We're having a lot of fun.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567138","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"fun"}]},{"text":"Du hattest eine Menge Zeit.","en":"You had plenty of time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/468","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"Das kostet eine Menge.","en":"It costs a lot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/270204","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to cost","l":"kosten"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Er begann, Gold in großen Mengen zu kaufen.","en":"He began buying gold in huge amounts.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to begin","l":"beginnen"},{"g":"gold"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"big","l":"groß"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to buy, to purchase"}]}]}